OL,3,ALatest UK figures on migration and
OL,4,Aasylum claims set to be released
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest data on net migration,
OL,7,Fvisas, small boat arrivals and the
OL,8,Fasylum system is due to be released at
OL,9,F09:30 GMT
OL,11,FUK net migration has been on a downward
OL,12,Ftrajectory, with figures in May showing
OL,13,Fit had fallen to 171,000 in 2025 - the
OL,14,Flowest level since 2012, excluding the
OL,15,FCovid pandemic
OL,17,FThe Office for National Statistics will
OL,18,Ftoday publish figures for the year
OL,19,Fending June 2026 - here's what the last
OL,20,Fbatch showed
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
